      "article_valid_from": null,
      "text_md": "Article 1\n\nThis Regulation establishes a minimum threshold for greenhouse gas emissions savings of recycled carbon fuels and specifies the methodology to calculate the greenhouse gas emissions savings from renewable liquid and gaseous transport fuels of non-biological origin and from recycled carbon fuels.",
      "text_sha256": "6e55f57fbccc0fee5596ea38227d86590e8727e9b8bf9c711c9d514ca73a2089",
      "md_span": {
        "start": 716,
        "end": 1023
      },
      "citations": []
    },
    {
      "anchor": "art_2",
      "provision_id": "eu-eurlex:32023r1185:2023-02-10--b9390ea940341c23df25bd44065af1c509b850ded36369d911d2e070286e57b4#art_2",
      "eli": null,
      "type": "article",
      "num": null,
      "heading": null,
      "path": [],
      "article_valid_from": null,
      "text_md": "Article 2\n\nThe greenhouse gas emissions savings from the use of recycled carbon fuels shall be at least 70 %.",
      "text_sha256": "3b026036e4c9733ec39ebf2bc82181cb2068ad19110473e4a6eb04aa7d4690a2",
      "md_span": {
        "start": 1056,
        "end": 1165
      },
      "citations": []
    },
    {
      "anchor": "art_3",
      "provision_id": "eu-eurlex:32023r1185:2023-02-10--b9390ea940341c23df25bd44065af1c509b850ded36369d911d2e070286e57b4#art_3",
      "eli": null,
      "type": "article",
      "num": null,
      "heading": null,
      "path": [],
      "article_valid_from": null,
      "text_md": "Article 3\n\nThe greenhouse gas emissions savings from renewable liquid and gaseous transport fuels of non-biological origin and from recycled carbon fuels shall be determined in accordance with the methodology set out in the Annex.",
      "text_sha256": "ff43e8cce002ca438bd14f2bd7a726d875197d50215cc97715df2dad9676184b",
      "md_span": {
        "start": 1198,
